{
  // The tests typecheck lane (bd tea-rags-mcp-89k7k.11). vitest transpiles
  // without checking, so a test fixture drifting from its declared port type
  // stayed green for commit cycles — the src lane (`type-check`) never sees
  // tests/, and eslint does not flag missing required properties. This config
  // runs the base compilerOptions over tests/** with noEmit.
  //
  // The exclude list is a RATCHET, not a waiver: every entry is a file with
  // PRE-EXISTING type errors (the lane's first run harvested 2476 errors
  // across 424 files; the follow-up bead tracks the burn-down). Fix a file,
  // remove its entry — the list only ever shrinks. A file NOT listed is
  // checked strictly: new drift fails the lane loudly. No suppressions.
